  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA value remains network-concentrated:</strong> the top chains continue to capture the majority of distributed issuance and often set near-term market direction. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPMW9RWUw3WWhrRDJRWk93eGVFZzRaTTlPTWdLdlA2S3hXeEZyOVBPMGhISlV5ZWFpZ2sxMXUyZzI2RGRUb3Z1Ukxmb0tGLWd2S2xGdEZmbDJhcU1RUlZFMjE0V1IxWkVfQU5TRHg3WW5ydGJVMGhBVVFPZkdSc0hoN2E5TkJLUXh2bWdNdGxuRi1YM000SDQwYUdIamZ2ZkZ3R0NBWm5HN0xGSkhPSEJISVIwS01OXzkt?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Robinhood&#x27;s crypto chain out-earned Ethereum in network revenue last quarter, exec says</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Institutional expansion is likely staged:</strong> large-scale adoption typically lands on proven networks first, then broadens as compliance, interoperability, and liquidity deepen. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPMUN1Y2UwSEFuMkZzbXFteEZETG5kUFkxaEVwREFod1dNLWRCRDZrNkIyOEdIQ1ZkRlR1RXFiOWhWa1BhenoybE1YZVVUaFlqYmQ5cGNOY1dLVGVRdUtRMzl3MUJKRlJYZ0s4ZjJBbHlkMWY0OWxMT0tRZWNpSk5fV0V1WlFlOUdDYXJ4dzJ4aVNhS0FBQWlPYVFqc1EtQmpXck1YQ0Fn?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Figure&#x27;s Karl Samsen on YLDS, a yield-bearing stablecoin built on Stellar</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Custody and issuance integrations are moving rankings first:</strong> Chains that win custody and issuance integrations usually pull distributed value share before the broader RWA market total catches up. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/markets/2026-11-06-hypercall-anthropic-linked-pre-ipo-options-market-435453\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hypercall to launch first Anthropic-linked pre-IPO options market</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
